# Local UI against the deployed staging backend and its real data.
#   npm run dev:staging
#
# VITE_API_URL is relative on purpose: every request goes to the Vite dev
# server, which forwards /api to VITE_PROXY_TARGET. The browser only ever
# sees one origin, so no CORS entry, cookie-policy change, or redeploy is
# needed on staging. See vite.config.ts and README.md.
VITE_API_URL=/api
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=https://staging.scalenexus.ai
